anisms - Software agents and learning algorithms - Web interface design and menu positioning - Touch-based vs. mouse-based interaction - VRML and virtual environments **Awards and Recognition:** - Best Paper Award at ICEIS 2005 - Emerald Highly Commended Award 2015 (for 2014 paper) **Earliest Publication Identified:** 2000 (WES Conference) All publications listed are peer-reviewed papers from international journals, conferences, or book chapters, confirming Pietro Murano's affiliation with computer science research institutions throughout this period.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"span_id\": \"s009\",\n      \"raw_start_step\": null,\n      \"raw_end_step\": null,\n      \"span_text\": \"Search for all publications by Iram N. Khan (also listed as I. N. Khan, affiliated with University of Salford, School of Computing, Science and Engineering) that were published BEFORE 2015. Check multiple academic databases including Google Scholar, DBLP, Semantic Scholar, ResearchGate, Scopus, and institutional profiles. For each paper found before 2015, record: (1) exact title, (2) year of publication, (3) venue/journal, (4) all co-authors. Focus on peer-reviewed papers (journal articles, conference papers). Be careful to distinguish this author from others with similar names by checking affiliations and research areas (HCI, user interfaces). Sort the results chronologically to identify their earliest publication if any exist.\\n---\\n\\\"Iram N. Khan\\\" OR \\\"I. N. Khan\\\" \\\"University of Salford\\\" before:2015\\n---\\n\\\"Iram N Khan\\\" HCI \\\"user interface\\\" publications\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"span_id\": \"s010\",\n      \"raw_start_step\": null,\n      \"raw_end_step\": null,\n      \"span_text\": \"Title: Just a moment https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Iram-Khan\\n---\\nIram N Khan Google Scholar University of Salford\\n---\\n\\\"Iram N Khan\\\" OR \\\"I N Khan\\\" \\\"pie menu\\\" OR \\\"menu design\\\" Salford\\n---\\n{ \\\"text\\\": \\\"Vol. 6, No. 9, Septembe